 105:     - Copy the anchor rectangle into the two missing corners of the implied
 106:       larger rectangle.
 107:     - Repeat the right-side control bars horizontally between the left and right
 108:       anchors, using their spacing as the period, and draw the outer top and
 109:       bottom borders in the first right-control color.
 110:     - Repeat the below-side control bars vertically between the top and bottom
 111:       anchors, using the same period, and draw the outer left and right borders
 112:       in the first below-control color.
